This directory contains only public Sovereign OS update verification keys.

Each key uses two files with the same safe key identifier:

  <key-id>.pem   Ed25519 public key in PEM SubjectPublicKeyInfo format
  <key-id>.json  trusted metadata with algorithm, channels, and revoked status

No preview key is installed until a production key is generated under the
custody decided in ADR-0006 (see docs/adrs/0006-production-signing-key-custody.md
in the source repository). An empty trust store fails closed and prevents
update installation.

Once a key exists and this directory is no longer empty, routine rotation
does not require manually copying files here again: `sovereign-update
rotate-trust` applies signed rotation manifests (see
update/README.md's "Trust Rotation v1" section in the source repository).
